{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津じゃ〜ん！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobDCWFLg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちはこんばんは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津玲奈です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気が付けば5月、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "早いものですね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "活動を復帰してから1ヶ月が過ぎたということで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "短いながら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "内容がギュッと濃縮された"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こい1ヶ月でした🎏"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "濃いといえば、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は濃いめのブラックコーヒーが大好き☕️"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからいつもコーヒーカフェを巡って"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美味しいコーヒー探しの旅に出ています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お家でコーヒーを淹れて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゼラチンで固めてコーヒーゼリーを作るのにも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハマっているんだ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お家カフェを1人で開いて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1人で楽しんでいます☕️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さてさて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここで１つ発表があります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうご存知の方もいらっしゃるとは思いますが、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私、小津"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「桜橋を教えてくれた」のMVに"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "参加しております！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "え！！！どこにいるかって？？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "えへへ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ナイショです🤫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ探し当ててみてください！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一発でわかったら"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "桜橋マスターです🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わからな